    <title>Adam: A Method for Stochastic
      Optimization</title>
    <updated>2017-01-30T01:27:54Z</updated>
    <summary>We introduce Adam, an algorithm for first-order gradient-based optimization of stochastic objective functions, based on adaptive estimates of lower-order moments. The method is straightforward to implement, is computationally efficient, has little memory requirements.</summary>
